# The controlled-routing v2 and v3 generation packages and its handoff are checksum-verified byte for byte
# (manifest.json, checksums.json), including their CRLF line endings: git treats them as binary so no
# line-ending conversion (on checkout, or by git am on a patch) can change them.
src/supportdesk/generation/controlled_v2/** binary
src/supportdesk/generation/controlled_v3/** binary
docs/generation/controlled-v2/** binary
